# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/frame/fixtures/damaged
# A shelf whose every photo is damaged says so once and points at the push.
wait-for No photograph can be opened
expect 2 photos could not be read. Push the album again from your computer.
expect Check for photos
expect-missing No photo on this shelf can be read
expect-missing Push them again
clean
shot damaged
# A fresh push adds a readable photo; Frame finds it when it is opened again.
companion frame push scripts/fixtures/frame/lighthouse.jpg --album Coast --sim
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-for Next photo
expect Try again
expect This photograph could not be opened.
clean
shot damaged-after-push
tap Next photo
wait-for-id next
wait-idle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Photo 3 of 3
expect lighthouse.jpg
clean
shot damaged-recovered
